#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__linked_value
msgid ""
"Value compared to the identification thresholds: the received value plus the"
" operations of the customer over the linked operations period of the point "
"of sale."
msgstr ""
"Valeur comparée aux seuils d'identification : la valeur reçue plus les "
"opérations du client sur la période des opérations liées du point de vente."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_customer_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_customer_threshold
msgid ""
"Value of an exchange operation, in the currency of the point of sale, above "
"which the customer must be identified. 0: never required. With a linked "
"operations period, the value of the operations of the customer over that "
"period is added."
msgstr ""
"Valeur d'une opération de change, dans la devise du point de vente, au-delà "
"de laquelle le client doit être identifié. 0 : jamais obligatoire. Avec une "
"période des opérations liées, la valeur des opérations du client sur cette "
"période est ajoutée."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__value_out
msgid ""
"Value of the notes handed back at the sell rate of the counter (the rate of "
"Odoo divided by 1 + the exchange sell margin, or the lower fixed rate)."
msgstr ""
"Valeur des billets rendus au taux de vente du guichet (le taux d'Odoo "
"divisé par 1 + la marge de vente de change, ou le plus bas des taux fixes)."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_nm_currency_exchange/static/src/app/exchange_popup/exchange_popup.xml:0
msgid "Value of the notes received"
msgstr "Valeur des billets reçus"

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__value_in
msgid ""
"Value of the notes received at the cash rate of the point of sale (the rate "
"of Odoo with the cash rate margin, or the fixed rate)."
msgstr ""
"Valeur des billets reçus au taux de caisse du point de vente (le taux d'Odoo"
" avec la marge du taux de caisse, ou le taux fixe)."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__linked_value
msgid "Value with Linked Operations"
msgstr "Valeur avec les opérations liées"

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_document_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_document_threshold
msgid ""
"Value, in the currency of the point of sale, above which the identity "
"document of the customer is recorded on the operation (with the linked "
"operations when a period is set). 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valeur, dans la devise du point de vente, au-delà de laquelle la pièce "
"d'identité du client est enregistrée sur l'opération (avec les opérations "
"liées lorsqu'une période est définie). 0 : jamais obligatoire."

